    "I think it might be a home intruder with weird looking glasses."

# game/nikroute3.rpy:11564
translate spanish sny5_f187774a:

    # "But then the rims of those big glasses look like they {i}blink.{/i}"
    "But then the rims of those big glasses look like they {i}blink.{/i}"

